<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 400,000 American-style call warrants, in four equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT ENTITLES THE HOLDER TO BUY ONE NIKKEI 225 INDEX.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.MAR.98		 PAYDATE   24.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF  18144.34 YEN</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	  ISSUE	  PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   17000 YEN     29.5 CHF     7.5 PCT    7.2 X</p>
<p> CALL	   18000 YEN     22.9 CHF     9.9 PCT    9.3 X</p>
<p> CALL	   19000 YEN     16.9 CHF     12.7 PCT   12.6 X</p>
<p> CALL	   20000 YEN     12.4 CHF     16.1 PCT   17.2 X</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
